{"id":"5f5d7ce8b2ae609a","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-separated-reflection-kernel.md","title":"Theorem — 闭对角是分离反射的核对","display":"Theorem — 闭对角是分离反射的核对","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-separated-reflection-kernel","aliases":["14-thm-separated-reflection-kernel"],"display":"Theorem — 闭对角是分离反射的核对","source_ref":"V.3 Lemma 5 and Corollary 6, printed pp.229–230; DjVu120–121","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]","[[14-df-isomorphism]]","[[14-df-separated-reflection-image]]","[[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure]]","[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf]]","[[14-thm-separated-diagonal]]","[[14-df-kernel-pairs-and-effective-equivalence-relations]]","[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-separated-reflection-kernel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-separated-reflection-kernel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — 闭对角是分离反射的核对"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"V.3 Lemma 5 and Corollary 6, printed pp.229–230; DjVu120–121"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" href=\"?note=1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" title=\"14-df-j-separated-objects\">14-df-j-separated-objects</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fb9c7afb199c12e2\" href=\"?note=fb9c7afb199c12e2\" title=\"14-df-separated-reflection-image\">14-df-separated-reflection-image</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"592d7bea8469dc16\" href=\"?note=592d7bea8469dc16\" title=\"14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier\">14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a169ef2f5263224b\" href=\"?note=a169ef2f5263224b\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure\">14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"59d5dc773385bba2\" href=\"?note=59d5dc773385bba2\" title=\"14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf\">14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d179a7fa180f99f9\" href=\"?note=d179a7fa180f99f9\" title=\"14-thm-separated-diagonal\">14-thm-separated-diagonal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2835ef59873188e3\" href=\"?note=2835ef59873188e3\" title=\"14-df-kernel-pairs-and-effective-equivalence-relations\">14-df-kernel-pairs-and-effective-equivalence-relations</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4cd3b0d29b80beda\" href=\"?note=4cd3b0d29b80beda\" title=\"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity\">14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E,j,A,W_A,S_j(A),q_A,m_A\">\\(\\mathcal E,j,A,W_A,S_j(A),q_A,m_A\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"fb9c7afb199c12e2\" href=\"?note=fb9c7afb199c12e2\" title=\"14-df-separated-reflection-image\">14-df-separated-reflection-image</a> 的数据。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_A\">\\(\\Delta_A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_{S_j(A)}\">\\(\\Delta_{S_j(A)}\\)</span> 为对角子对象；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_A\\times q_A:A\\times A\\to S_j(A)\\times S_j(A)\">\\(q_A\\times q_A:A\\times A\\to S_j(A)\\times S_j(A)\\)</span> 使用选定积箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 为任意对象，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:A\\to B\">\\(f:A\\to B\\)</span> 为箭头。闭包、核对、分离性在同一环境范畴中解释。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" href=\"?note=1ff1b9c370bbaad1\" title=\"14-df-j-separated-objects\">14-df-j-separated-objects</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsIso}(u)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsIso}(u)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a>，表示该环境范畴中的双侧逆箭头存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(S_j(A),j,\\mathcal E).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(S_j(A),j,\\mathcal E).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(q_A\\times q_A)^*(\\Delta_{S_j(A)})=\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,A\\times A}(\\Delta_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(q_A\\times q_A)^*(\\Delta_{S_j(A)})=\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,A\\times A}(\\Delta_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(B,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists!g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S_j(A),B)\\quad g\\circ q_A=f.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(B,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists!g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S_j(A),B)\\quad g\\circ q_A=f.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(A,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsIso}(q_A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(A,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsIso}(q_A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源说明：以下来源定位与历史核对经历为所附原稿的记录；本次核对对象为本对话提供的数学笔记。</p>\n<p>原书 V.3 Lemma 5、Corollary 6，印刷229–230页，DjVu120–121，陈述与证明已逐项比对。</p>\n<p>由<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"592d7bea8469dc16\" href=\"?note=592d7bea8469dc16\" title=\"14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier\">14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier</a>及<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"a169ef2f5263224b\" href=\"?note=a169ef2f5263224b\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure\">14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_A=\\Omega_j^A\">\\(W_A=\\Omega_j^A\\)</span> 是层；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"59d5dc773385bba2\" href=\"?note=59d5dc773385bba2\" title=\"14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf\">14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf</a>给其子对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_j(A)\">\\(S_j(A)\\)</span> 分离。核对等式可按原书的闭图像论证检验：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_Af=\\kappa_Ag\">\\(\\kappa_Af=\\kappa_Ag\\)</span> 等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g:B\\to A\">\\(f,g:B\\to A\\)</span> 的闭图像相同；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的图像包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 的闭图像，拉回后说明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(g,f)\">\\((g,f)\\)</span> 因子化通过闭对角。反向，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_A\">\\(\\kappa_A\\)</span> 的两复合在对角上相等，又因其目标为层而在稠密的对角闭包上相等。因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m_A\">\\(m_A\\)</span> 单，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa_A\">\\(\\kappa_A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_A\">\\(q_A\\)</span> 核对相同。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 分离，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的两复合在对角闭包上相等：两箭头先在对角相等，再用分离性沿该稠密包含消去。拓扑斯中正则满态射是其核对的余等化子，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 唯一通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_A\">\\(q_A\\)</span>。最后，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 分离时闭对角就是对角，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_A\">\\(q_A\\)</span> 同时正则满且单，是同构；反向由分离性在同构下不变得到。没有把一般正则范畴中任意等价关系都默认为有效。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-j-separated-objects","status":"resolved","id":"1ff1b9c370bbaad1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-j-separated-objects]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-separated-reflection-image","status":"resolved","id":"fb9c7afb199c12e2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-separated-reflection-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"592d7bea8469dc16","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a169ef2f5263224b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"59d5dc773385bba2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-separated-diagonal","status":"resolved","id":"d179a7fa180f99f9","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-separated-diagonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-kernel-pairs-and-effective-equivalence-relations","status":"resolved","id":"2835ef59873188e3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-kernel-pairs-and-effective-equivalence-relations]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity","status":"resolved","id":"4cd3b0d29b80beda","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-separated-reflection-image","status":"resolved","id":"fb9c7afb199c12e2","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal E,j,A,W_A,S_j(A),q_A,m_A$ 使用 [[14-df-separated-reflection-image]] 的数据。$\\Delta_A$、$\\Delta_{S_j(A)}$ 为对角子对象；$q_A\\times q_A:A\\times A\\to S_j(A)\\times S_j(A)$ 使用选定积箭头。$B$ 为任意对象，$f:A\\to B$ 为箭头。闭包、核对、分离性在同一环境范畴中解释。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-j-separated-objects","status":"resolved","id":"1ff1b9c370bbaad1","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$ 采用 [[14-df-j-separated-objects]]；$\\mathrm{IsIso}(u)$ 采用 [[14-df-isomorphism]]，表示该环境范畴中的双侧逆箭头存在。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"d5f547b903550705","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)$ 采用 [[14-df-j-separated-objects]]；$\\mathrm{IsIso}(u)$ 采用 [[14-df-isomorphism]]，表示该环境范畴中的双侧逆箭头存在。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier","status":"resolved","id":"592d7bea8469dc16","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"由[[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier]]及[[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure]]，$W_A=\\Omega_j^A$ 是层；[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf]]给其子对象 $S_j(A)$ 分离。核对等式可按原书的闭图像论证检验：$\\kappa_Af=\\kappa_Ag$ 等价于 $f,g:B\\to A$ 的闭图像相同；$f$ 的图像包含于 $g$ 的闭图像，拉回后说明 $(g,f)$ 因子化通过闭对角。反向，$\\kappa_A$ 的两复合在对角上相等，又因其目标为层而在稠密的对角闭包上相等。因 $m_A$ 单，$\\kappa_A$ 与 $q_A$ 核对相同。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure","status":"resolved","id":"a169ef2f5263224b","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"由[[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier]]及[[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure]]，$W_A=\\Omega_j^A$ 是层；[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf]]给其子对象 $S_j(A)$ 分离。核对等式可按原书的闭图像论证检验：$\\kappa_Af=\\kappa_Ag$ 等价于 $f,g:B\\to A$ 的闭图像相同；$f$ 的图像包含于 $g$ 的闭图像，拉回后说明 $(g,f)$ 因子化通过闭对角。反向，$\\kappa_A$ 的两复合在对角上相等，又因其目标为层而在稠密的对角闭包上相等。因 $m_A$ 单，$\\kappa_A$ 与 $q_A$ 核对相同。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"59d5dc773385bba2","anchor":"ref-15","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"由[[14-thm-j-sheaf-subobject-classifier]]及[[14-thm-sheaf-limit-exponential-closure]]，$W_A=\\Omega_j^A$ 是层；[[14-thm-closed-subobject-sheaf]]给其子对象 $S_j(A)$ 分离。核对等式可按原书的闭图像论证检验：$\\kappa_Af=\\kappa_Ag$ 等价于 $f,g:B\\to A$ 的闭图像相同；$f$ 的图像包含于 $g$ 的闭图像，拉回后说明 $(g,f)$ 因子化通过闭对角。反向，$\\kappa_A$ 的两复合在对角上相等，又因其目标为层而在稠密的对角闭包上相等。因 $m_A$ 单，$\\kappa_A$ 与 $q_A$ 核对相同。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal E,j,A,W_A,S_j(A),q_A,m_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_{S_j(A)}","display":false},{"tex":"q_A\\times q_A:A\\times A\\to S_j(A)\\times S_j(A)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"f:A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(X,j,\\mathcal E)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsIso}(u)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(S_j(A),j,\\mathcal E).","display":true},{"tex":"(q_A\\times q_A)^*(\\Delta_{S_j(A)})=\\mathrm{Cl}_{j,A\\times A}(\\Delta_A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(B,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists!g\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal E}(S_j(A),B)\\quad g\\circ q_A=f.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsJSeparated}(A,j,\\mathcal E)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsIso}(q_A).","display":true},{"tex":"W_A=\\Omega_j^A","display":false},{"tex":"S_j(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_Af=\\kappa_Ag","display":false},{"tex":"f,g:B\\to A","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"(g,f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_A","display":false},{"tex":"m_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa_A","display":false},{"tex":"q_A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"q_A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"q_A","display":false}],"bytes":3077,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-197","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separated-reflection-kernel|thm-279 — 闭对角是分离反射的核对]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-124","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separated-reflection-kernel]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-281","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separated-reflection-kernel]]"},{"id":"b2640a98d95a570c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"fb9c7afb199c12e2","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$j^2=j$ 保证 $j\\delta_A$ 唯一通过等化子 $e_j$，所以 $c_A$ 存在唯一；指数普遍性质保证 $\\kappa_A$ 唯一。像分解由[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]给出；固定代表不会改变所得反射的同构类。这里没有预先假定 $S_j(A)$ 已分离，分离性与泛性质在[[14-thm-separated-reflection-kernel]]证明。"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-64","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separated-reflection-kernel]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-203","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separated-reflection-kernel]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-198","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-separated-reflection-kernel|thm-279 — 闭对角是分离反射的核对]]"},{"id":"2529efea1cd2e435","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"层性由[[14-df-lt-sheafification-object]]的闭子层构造得到。任意 $A\\to B$ 先由[[14-thm-separated-reflection-kernel]]唯一下降到 $S_j(A)$，再沿稠密 $d_A$ 唯一延拓到层 $B$。这也证明箭头作用的唯一描述有定义，保持恒等、复合和单位自然性；$\\Phi$ 对 $A,B$ 的自然性直接来自复合结合律，所以给出伴随。"}],"outgoing":["1ff1b9c370bbaad1","d5f547b903550705","fb9c7afb199c12e2","592d7bea8469dc16","a169ef2f5263224b","59d5dc773385bba2","d179a7fa180f99f9","2835ef59873188e3","4cd3b0d29b80beda"]}